# Files in the repo that must NOT be served from the public site.
#
# wrangler uploads every file under assets.directory, which here is the repo
# root — there is no build output directory to point at, because this app has
# no build step. So the exclusions live here instead. Same syntax as .gitignore.
#
# The repo is public, so nothing below is secret; the point is that development
# material is not part of the product and should not be reachable at
# psychometric-assist.com.

# Development notes and the numeric regression harness.
CLAUDE.md
tools

# Deploy configuration itself.
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore

# Editor, VCS and tooling detritus.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
node_modules
.DS_Store
*.ps1
*.ipynb
